        "TileImage": "$($repository 2b305eb4-a0f9-4b30-a1f4-0e398cb6b95c).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47. To celebrate the inauguration of &apos;The Sceptre&apos;, Omar Al-Ghazali has asked artist/designer Lucy Phillips to present her new &apos;Accumulus&apos; installation at the ceremony. Our client, designer Wilfred Silver, a rival of Phillips, has asked us to dispose of her, as well as fashion designer Sebastian Sato, who will also be in attendence. Also, we been asked to eliminate famed art critic Richard Voltaire, whom has been bribed by Al-Ghazali to give Phillips installation a high rating.",
